Their dad uploaded the video because they just want—
他们的爸爸上传了这个视频，因为他们只是想——

664
00:28:58.930 --> 00:29:00.670
In case you needed to know what her accents were.
以防你需要知道她们是什么口音。

665
00:29:01.250 --> 00:29:01.730
Exactly.
没错。

666
00:29:02.090 --> 00:29:06.110
The dad had uploaded the video because he just wanted to share it with their godfather.
爸爸上传这个视频只是想和他们的教父分享一下。

667
00:29:06.530 --> 00:29:08.390
