This whole time Michael and Holly are going back and forth, Erin is preoccupied with the ant farm.
整个过程中迈克尔和霍莉一直在来回拉扯，而艾琳则全神贯注于蚂蚁农场。

696
00:30:39.410 --> 00:30:40.510
It's so funny.
太搞笑了。

697
00:30:40.770 --> 00:30:43.090
Holly has sort of tucked it under her arm, right?
霍莉把它夹在胳膊下面，对吧？

698
