00:33:49.310 --> 00:33:56.990
Part of it is in deleted scenes, and we learn about Holly's friend, Lois, and pretty much how she drives Michael crazy.
其中一部分在删减片段里，我们了解到了霍莉的朋友洛伊丝，以及她是如何让迈克尔抓狂的。

